      "claim": "All transferable fasted-state human absolute F records are above the 20% threshold (GSK1322322 57%, suvorexant 82%, zalcitabine 80%, cladribine 36–46%, asciminib ~73%, elinzanetant 36.7%), and animal records are also supportive.",
